Lost in the Snow

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_8_DESC]
“The only thing we have to fear is fear itself.”

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_8_MARK]
“Eventually, he left her.”

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_8_NEWS_NAME]
Lost in the Snow

[l_english.EVENT_SUPER_8_NEWS_DESC]
In that world covered with ice and snow, he went to find her, lost in the snow, and she never found him back.

